title: Door3B
---
// Talk target of 3B's door on the landing (Hotspots layer). It opens with the actions
// here: a popup when several are available, the only one at once.
-> Knock <<if $chapter == "R1Viewing" and not $gate_r1_view_knock>>
    <<next_scene Route1Viewing>>
-> Go in <<if $chapter == "R1MoveIn" and not $gate_r1_move_keys>>
    You: Locked. She has my keys.
-> Go in <<if $gate_r1_move_keys>>
    <<open_door Door3B>>
    <<walk Player PlayerInto3B>>
    <<close_door Door3B>>
-> Look
    <<if $chapter == "R1Viewing">>
        You: 3B. The one from the listing.
    <<else>>
        You: 3B. My door. Still feels like someone else's.
    <<endif>>
===
